# Arm D: same compressed reset sequence and H1000 optimizer cadence as B,
# while independent position/omega CVaR events remain on complete H500 blocks.
# Gradients from both H500 blocks accumulate into one H1000 commit. This is a
# default-off probe for CVaR event density and total event mass at fixed commit
# count, not a pure cadence intervention or a promoted policy.
@configs/continuity_cadence_common.args
--episode-horizon-schedule compressed-t2-10pct
--optimization-block-horizon 0
--tail-supervision-block-horizon 500
